 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2025 年 11 月，Balancer V2 的稳定池，被人取走了资金。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 11 月，Balancer V2 的稳定池，被人取走了资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.805
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "官方复盘估算，用户资金被盗约 9480 万美元。",
   "spoken": "官方复盘估算，用户资金被盗约 9480 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.86,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 6.958,
   "speechEnd": 11.362
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "根因，被定位在一处取整错误。",
   "spoken": "根因，被定位在一处取整错误。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.432,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 12.53,
   "speechEnd": 15.172
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "单次交换的误差很小。",
   "spoken": "单次交换的误差很小。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.228,
   "dur": 2.52,
   "speechStart": 16.326,
   "speechEnd": 17.921
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "攻击者把大量小额交换，串进一笔批量交换。",
   "spoken": "攻击者把大量小额交换，串进一笔批亮交换。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 18.968,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 19.066,
   "speechEnd": 22.435
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "每一步的误差，都朝对自己有利的方向累积。",
   "spoken": "每一步的误差，都朝对自己有利的方向垒积。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 23.508,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 23.606,
   "speechEnd": 26.641
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "先猜一道题。金库里，每份额值 1.5 个最小资产单位。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。金库里，每份额值 1.5 个最小资产单位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 27.712,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 27.81,
   "speechEnd": 32.629
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "铸造 1 份额时，合约把应收的 1.5 向下取整，只收 1 个单位。",
   "spoken": "铸造 1 份额时，合约把应收的 1.5 向下取整，只收 1 个单位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.692,
   "dur": 5.376,
   "speechStart": 33.79,
   "speechEnd": 38.23
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "重复 1000 次，调用者多拿了多少？",
   "spoken": "虫复 1000 次，掉用者多拿了多少？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.288,
   "dur": 3.408,
   "speechStart": 39.386,
   "speechEnd": 41.85
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "大约 500 个单位。这些差额，来自其他持有人。",
   "spoken": "大约 500 个单位。这些差额，来自其他持有人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-09.mp3",
   "start": 43.196,
   "dur": 4.872,
   "speechStart": 43.294,
   "speechEnd": 47.232
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "EVM 只有整数。每一次除法，都会丢掉余数。",
   "spoken": "EVM 只有整数。每一次除法，都会丢掉余数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-10.mp3",
   "start": 48.288,
   "dur": 5.064,
   "speechStart": 48.386,
   "speechEnd": 52.514
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "丢掉的余数归谁，决定了谁能从协议里，慢慢抠出钱。",
   "spoken": "丢掉的余数归谁，决定了谁能从协议里，慢慢抠出钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-11.mp3",
   "start": 53.572,
   "dur": 5.784,
   "speechStart": 53.67,
   "speechEnd": 58.515
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "这一集讲三件事：数学缺陷，舍入方向，金库通胀。",
   "spoken": "这一集讲三件事：数学缺陷，舍入方向，金库通胀。",
